/brokenbrow-2021-01-22","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brokenbrow-2021-01-22#:~:text=Soon%20the%20Skelle%20were,across%20the%20open%20plains.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Brokenbrow\" by Roy Graham, Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"brokenbrow-2021-01-22-e7","era":null,"summary":"Hormgart begins the tale of how Arni, once called Goatleaper, got his new name (a story told in flashback).","participants":["hormgart","njala","arni-brokenbrow"],"location":"starnheim","importance":"minor","page":"stories/brokenbrow-2021-01-22","order":634,"story_date":"2021-01-22","storyline":"Kaldheim","source":"wizards","paragraph":27,"quote":"He was called Goatleaper, once,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brokenbrow-2021-01-22#:~:text=He%20was%20called%20Goatleaper%2C%20once%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Brokenbrow","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Roy Graham","Jenna Helland"],"date":"2021-01-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brokenbrow-2021-01-22","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brokenbrow-2021-01-22#:~:text=He%20was%20called%20Goatleaper%2C%20once%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Brokenbrow\" by Roy Graham, Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Jan 2021."}},{"id":"brokenbrow-2021-01-22-e8","era":null,"summary":"In Hormgart's tale, word of murderous trolls on the Red Ridge spreads and Arni's small band begins hunting them (flashback).","participants":["arni-brokenbrow","tuskeri"],"location":"red-ridge","importance":"minor","page":"stories/brokenbrow-2021-01-22","order":634,"story_date":"2021-01-22","storyline":"Kaldheim","source":"wizards","paragraph":28,"quote":"word spread of a scourge of murderous trolls, terrorizing villages all along the Red Ridge","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brokenbrow-2021-01-22#:~:text=word%20spread%20o